      <title>Poland Is a Warning for Vengeful US Democrats</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-14/poland-is-a-warning-for-vengeful-us-democrats</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">61edf9868af2b17a00f13e5b</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:00:19 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Poles, shocked by a mass shooting in the heart of the historic city of Krakow, might have been comforted that their fractious political class was at least willing to mourn together. In the aftermath, the right-wing President Karol Nawrocki and the liberal pro-European Prime Minister Donald Tusk laid down candles together in the town’s main market square.</description>
      <dc:creator>Mihir Sharma</dc:creator>
